In this research, we implement evolving creatures on blockchain. Blockchain is the underlying technology for cryptocurrencies such as Bitcoin (
Nakamoto, 2008
), and has received much attention in recent years. Blockchain is a robust distributed ledger that uses consensus algorithms such as Proof-of-Work (
Nakamoto, 2008
) and Proof-of-Stake (
Sunny King, 2012
) to approve transactions in a decentralized manner, making malicious tampering extremely difficult.

